  If you have a hardware service contract and are the customer contact, call
800-354-9000 and follow the prompts for hardware service. If you don't have
a hardware contract and want someone to come out and fix it, that number should
work as well. If you want to return the board to DEC for repair, call 800-
225-5385 and ask for Digital Assisted Services. If you want to carry the term-
inal, complete, to a DEC location for repair, call the 225 number and ask for
the location of the nearest "carry-in ServiCenter".

  If you discover that all of those are too expensive, call a used equipment
dealer and buy a whole new unit. I use Compunet International, 800-767-9779.
Ask for Tom Loonan and tell him I sent you.

