|>hi,
|>	we have a 3000L DEC Alpha workstation which does not seem to have
|>an audio device. is there actually no audio device on the machine ?
|>the keyboard has a small speaker which beeps on errors etc. also during
|>boot up when the machine is doing checks on the system, one hears a bit
|>of music for around 5-6 seconds from the base of the machine. but i
|>wasn't able to find any audio device in /dev. 
|>
