>  How do I get the alpha to route the traffic between the two
>networks?

I use the following incantation:

	/usr/sbin/slattach +c /dev/tty00 <speed>
	/sbin/ifconfig sl0 <ip1> <ip2> netmask <mask>
	/usr/sbin/iprsetup -s   # this is required to achieve routing

This works, but as I had mentioned in a post without response, the routing
isn't good: data seems to transfer at the correct speed, but then there
are pauses of several (~ 10) seconds between packets from time to time,
the average transfer rate being abysmally low.

