    The typical reason for slowness is that the host O/S doesn't recognize
    the product name string.  It is most common, in these cases, for the
    host to disable the DLTs internal cache memory.  This results in
    dramatically slower throughputs.  Application notes are available for
    most connected hosts to resolve this problem.  Contact me if further
