As discussed earlier this year in comp.os.vms, VMS will backup faster on
a TZ87 than the oem version, because the device driver checks for the 
TZ87 & TZ877 and recognizes that they have internal cache. But the
driver treats the oem version , DLT 2000 (?) as a generic scsi tape.

