I have to admit I've never seen one of these machines with an ISA board in it.

Still, are you sure that SHOW CONFIG is intended to show you ISA boards? One
possible implementation of SHOW CONFIG would simply probe the EISA bus for
boards. That procedure would not see an ISA board. The console wouldn't support
it in any case - it would at best show up with question marks next to it.

The better question is whether your operating system (VMS or OSF?) sees the
board.

