Does remote starting via DECnet work?
Check SYS$SYSTEM:PCX$SERVER.COM - be sure that it's there, that
it's protections are set correctly (see Appendix A of the eXcursion
manual), and that it's in the proper form ($EDIT/TPU PCX$SERVER.COM and
check for extra characters at the end of each line - a binary transfer
via FTP or NFT or through a PATHWORKS service can cause this file to
have extra characters that muck it up).

