thus transforming the last few elements of the array "termspeeds"
from:
        { 4800,  B4800 },  { 9600,  B9600 }, { 19200, B19200 },
        { 38400, B38400 }, { -1,    B38400 }
to:
        { 4800,  B4800 },  { 9600,  B9600 }, { 19200, B9600 },
        { 38400, B9600 },  { -1,    B9600 }

thus returning -1 for any speed > B9600.

