Actually most VAXen won't run without a PDP-11.  78x use an LSI-11 as console,
86x0 use a weird T-11 based system, and several (unknown to me) use a PRO-380

The 86x0's power supplies are sequenced by the T-11 and the microcode is loaded
by it as well.  So until theT-11 (and RT-11 boot from the RL02) the "VAX" doesn't
even understand its instruction set.

