It's very annoying when low-level documentation for anything cannot be
obtained.  Years ago, even most household electrical/electronics
devices like air-conditioners and radios came with schematics.  It was
fairly commen to open up the cabinets for many things and find a
schematic diagram glued somewhere inside.  Most other things came with
a schematic, and often specifications, inside the owner's manual.  One
