Subject: Getting dd to pad the *last* output block
Message-ID: <Cu9x20.33G@adasoft.ch>
Reply-To: jw@adasoft.ch (Jamie Watson)
Organization: Adasoft AG, Switzerland
Date: Tue, 9 Aug 1994 15:15:36 GMT
