Well, you normally had a double-ported RP06, which had a file system
for the 11/40, as well as a file system for the DEC-20 on it, from
which everything booted, but the RX02 was there too.

If a "bay" is one 22" cabinet (they were paired), then our system had
8 bays, plus a TU45, when it was at its top. (And 3 RP06 and one RP07).
