>maintain. 

Have to point a few things out here. RMS is not a file system, but
a library of routines to use by the program. You had RMS on TOPS-20
too. :-)

>>>The system was TOPS-10, or TOPS-20. This system felt good, with a nice
>>>auto-completion feature, a weird file system (with file versions,
