Hi,

I had a DEC5000/200 (Ultrix 4.2a) crashing too after panicking when trying
xdm from X11R6, using the Xdec server.
However, I noticed that  the old xdm-config file was not fully compatible,
whereas the old one had a line like: 
:0 local /usr/bin/Xws blah blah blah

the new should have an extra string before 'local', e.g.:

:0 Local local /usr/X11R6/bin/Xdec blah blah

After I changed this, it would run in My case.

Goodluck!
Andre Nieuwland

PS: I am interested too in how to be able to see which graphics card
    (monitor(type)) is installed.





