Okay.  Are you using MN.COM to start the applications from the eXcursion 
side?  In the "Application" definition you would use:

mn.com decw$session

mn.com can be found in c:\xcursion\remote and must be transfered up to the 
VMS host and put in the same place as pcx$server.com.  (Check the 
protections on it.  Must be world read, execute.)

Also, what version of Multinet?  3.2D doesn't work with eXcursion unless you
get a patch from TGV.


