You answered your own question.  It appears to be a bug in the optimizer
of the V3.3 compiler, which is fixed in V3.4.   The Fortran people tell
me that there were some optimizer problems in V3.3 that were related to
code similiar to your example.   These problems were fixed in V3.4.

Is there some reason you cannot use V3.4 or were you just curious?

